<title>USA: Wickes Lumber changes name to Wickes Inc.</title>
<headline>Wickes Lumber changes name to Wickes Inc.</headline>
<dateline>VERNON HILLS, Ill. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wickes Lumber Co said Wednesday it will change its name to Wickes Inc effective in early June.</p>
<p>The company said shareholders approved the name change at the annual meeting held on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Wickes said the name change was made to reflect the company's continued expansion of its services to the building industry.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
